{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "I Got Isekai'd Into a Shmup",
    "steam_appid": 2870000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/106a701d8d91512d13fea4dc638b7f27.avif?t=1729342166\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an exhausting day\u2026 You return home with your new shmup in hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black out! You wake up in the midst of a space battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to be one of the four pilots and hold the fate of this world in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/1953f5f3af0bd3a1b7555fee965b58f2.poster.avif?t=1729342166\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/1953f5f3af0bd3a1b7555fee965b58f2.webm?t=1729342166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/1953f5f3af0bd3a1b7555fee965b58f2.mp4?t=1729342166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable for 1 to 4 players: Invite your friends for an intense cooperative experience! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Story Mode to experience the game's adventure through dialogue and comic-style introductions, or dive into Arcade Mode for uninterrupted action. Both modes feature three difficulty levels: Normal, Hard, and Manic.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Boss Rush Mode by completing the game! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 unique worlds, each with its own challenges and secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from 4 ships with varied shooting styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock bonus scenes to delve deeper into the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and complete a mysterious bestiary. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim high with 45 unlockable achievements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against friends with scoreboards for each difficulty level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support screen rotations, play as you like. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to top it all off, an epic soundtrack, fueled by custom-made instrumental metal! \ud83c\udfb6\ud83e\udd18 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into the action, dodge tons of bullets, and save this world teetering on the edge of chaos! \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/6232767ab0dd0df63c1e296a5b39c59e.avif?t=1729342166\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/9b36cbc56db03628693cd4648d4e93c3.avif?t=1729342166\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/106a701d8d91512d13fea4dc638b7f27.avif?t=1729342166\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an exhausting day\u2026 You return home with your new shmup in hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black out! You wake up in the midst of a space battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to be one of the four pilots and hold the fate of this world in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/1953f5f3af0bd3a1b7555fee965b58f2.poster.avif?t=1729342166\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/1953f5f3af0bd3a1b7555fee965b58f2.webm?t=1729342166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/1953f5f3af0bd3a1b7555fee965b58f2.mp4?t=1729342166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable for 1 to 4 players: Invite your friends for an intense cooperative experience! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Story Mode to experience the game's adventure through dialogue and comic-style introductions, or dive into Arcade Mode for uninterrupted action. Both modes feature three difficulty levels: Normal, Hard, and Manic.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Boss Rush Mode by completing the game! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 unique worlds, each with its own challenges and secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from 4 ships with varied shooting styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock bonus scenes to delve deeper into the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and complete a mysterious bestiary. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim high with 45 unlockable achievements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against friends with scoreboards for each difficulty level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support screen rotations, play as you like. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to top it all off, an epic soundtrack, fueled by custom-made instrumental metal! \ud83c\udfb6\ud83e\udd18 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into the action, dodge tons of bullets, and save this world teetering on the edge of chaos! \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/6232767ab0dd0df63c1e296a5b39c59e.avif?t=1729342166\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/9b36cbc56db03628693cd4648d4e93c3.avif?t=1729342166\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "I Got Isekai\u2019d into a Shmup is a vertical shoot\u2019em up game inspired by the best games of the 90s genre, while adding exciting features and local co-op for up to 4 players.",
